generate_quiz.prompt:
You are a quiz question generator for a college-level course.

Source material:
{source_material}

Generate exactly {num_questions} {question_type} questions about: {topic}

Return ONLY valid JSON (no markdown fences, no explanation) in this exact format:
{"title": "Quiz: <short title>", "questions": [{"question_text": "<p>The question</p>", "question_type": "multiple_choice_question", "points_possible": {points}, "answers": [{"text": "Answer text", "correct": true}, {"text": "Wrong answer", "correct": false}, {"text": "Wrong answer", "correct": false}, {"text": "Wrong answer", "correct": false}]}]}

For true_false_question, provide exactly 2 answers (True and False).
For short_answer_question, provide 1-3 acceptable answers, all marked correct.
For essay_question, omit the answers array.
For a mix, vary the question types.

generate_from_reading.prompt:
Based on the following course material, generate {num_questions} {question_type} questions that test student comprehension at the college level. Questions should require understanding, not just memorization.

Material:
{source_material}

Focus on: {topic}

Return ONLY valid JSON (no markdown fences): {"title": "Quiz: <topic>", "questions": [{"question_text": "<p>...</p>", "question_type": "multiple_choice_question", "points_possible": {points}, "answers": [{"text": "...", "correct": true}, {"text": "...", "correct": false}, {"text": "...", "correct": false}, {"text": "...", "correct": false}]}]}
